{"title":"Desert Wolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 25 Desert Wolf that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (0.5% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: packDamagePerAlly: .1</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/wolf-sinew\">Wolf Sinew</a> <span class=\"muted\">(crafting catalyst)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Enchanter’s Table</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=25\">Lv 25 <span>134</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=26\">Lv 26 <span>138</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>9</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>8</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>25</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>89</td><td>18.3</td><td>1,250</td><td class=\"muted\">267 · 25.6 · 3,750</td><td>134</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=26\" title=\"Pick level 26\"><td><b>26</b></td><td>94</td><td>18.8</td><td>1,300</td><td class=\"muted\">282 · 26.3 · 3,900</td><td>138</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/desert-wolf?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>9</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Alpha's%20Rock\">Alpha&#39;s Rock</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"desert-wolf\" data-map-level=\"25\">Show level 25 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"jackal-pelt\" title=\"Jackal Pelt - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 9 total, 2–4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a527c3adeb957a426463.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Jackal Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×2–4</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"wolf-meat\" title=\"Wolf Meat - in 3 of 4 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3754737ea3fb2fec593a.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Wolf Meat</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"sunbleached-fang\" title=\"Sunbleached Fang - in 2 of 4 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 9 total, 1–8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/87ff80ab6feed9f385f8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Sunbleached Fang</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2<br>×1–8</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-torso\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Torso - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a1901275f30658477144.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-medium\" title=\"Health Potion Medium - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Medium</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-feet\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Feet - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/79897c1ee4bf7477b88b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-medium\" title=\"Mana Potion Medium - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/dce7b61a763deccad88f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\"